omial in \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline124.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"9\" height=\"14\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline124.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\mathsf {L}$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E and \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline125.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"27\" height=\"17\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline125.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n${\\mathsf {S}}_{12}$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E Bergström and Faber recently used point counting techniques to compute the cohomology of \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline126.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"47\" height=\"25\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline126.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n${\\overline {\\mathcal {M}}}_{3,n}$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E as an \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline127.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline127.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"tex