ble=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\widetilde {\\Delta }$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, the span of \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline377.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"159\" height=\"25\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline377.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\Delta _{ij} \\cdot H^{k-2}(\\mathcal {C}^{\\{i, j\\}^c})$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, where \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline378.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"27\" height=\"21\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline378.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\Delta _{ij}$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E denotes the pullback of the class of the diagonal in \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline379.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"89\" height=\"23\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline379.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$H^2(\\mathcal {C}^{\\{i,j\\}})$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp class=\"p continuation\"\u003ENote that \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline380.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"14\" height=\"20\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline380.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\widetilde {\\Delta }$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E lies in the kernel of \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline381.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"191\" height=\"25\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline381.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$H^k(\\mathcal {C}^n) \\to H^k({\\mathcal {M}}_{g,n})$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, and the images of the weight \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003Ek\u003C\u002Fem\u003E parts of \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline382.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"15\" height=\"19\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline382.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\widetilde {\\Phi }$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E and \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline383.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline383.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\widetilde {\\Psi }$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E under \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline384.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"244\" height=\"25\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline384.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$W_kH^k(\\mathcal {C}^n) \\to W_kH^k({\\mathcal {M}}_{g,n})$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E are the subspaces \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline385.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"39\" height=\"27\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline385.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\Phi ^k_{g,n}$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E and \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline386.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"39\" height=\"27\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline386.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\Psi ^k_{g,n}$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, respectively. To prove part (a), it thus suffices to show that \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cdiv data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"disp-formula\" data-magellan-destination=\"eqn9\" id=\"eqn9\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"label\"\u003E(3.1)\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqn9.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"439\" height=\"49\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqn9.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$$ \\begin{align} H^k(\\mathcal{C}^n)\u002F(\\widetilde{\\Phi} + \\widetilde{\\Psi} + \\widetilde{\\Delta}) \\cong \\bigoplus_{|\\lambda|=n} H^{k-n}({\\mathcal{M}}_g, \\mathbb{V}_{\\lambda}) \\otimes V_{\\lambda^T}. \\end{align} $$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cp class=\"p continuation\"\u003EWe explain how (\u003Ca class=\"xref disp-formula\" href=\"#eqn9\"\u003E3.1\u003C\u002Fa\u003E) follows from [\u003Ca class=\"xref bibr\" href=\"#r29\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"show-for-sr\"\u003EReference Petersen, Tavakol and Yin\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E29\u003C\u002Fa\u003E].\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E Since \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline387.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"115\" height=\"22\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline387.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$f\\colon \\mathcal {C}^n \\to {\\mathcal {M}}_g$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E is smooth and proper, the Leray spectral sequence degenerates at \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline388.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"21\" height=\"17\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline388.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$E_2$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, and by [\u003Ca class=\"xref bibr\" href=\"#r12\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"show-for-sr\"\u003EReference Deligne\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E12\u003C\u002Fa\u003E, Proposition 2.16], we have a direct sum decomposition \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cdiv data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"disp-formula\" data-magellan-destination=\"eqnU20\" id=\"eqnU20\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqnu20.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"292\" height=\"49\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqnu20.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$$\\begin{align*}H^k(\\mathcal{C}^n) = \\bigoplus_{p+q = k}H^p({\\mathcal{M}}_g, R^q f_*\\mathbb{Q}). \\end{align*}$$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cp class=\"p continuation\"\u003EApplying the Künneth formula, we obtain \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cdiv data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"disp-formula\" data-magellan-destination=\"eqn10\" id=\"eqn10\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"label\"\u003E(3.2)\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqn10.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"465\" height=\"64\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqn10.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$$ \\begin{align} H^k(\\mathcal{C}^n) = \\bigoplus_{\\substack{p + q = k \\\\i_1 + \\ldots+ i_n = q }} H^p\\left({\\mathcal{M}}_g, R^{i_1} \\pi_* \\mathbb{Q} \\otimes \\cdots \\otimes R^{i_n} \\pi_* \\mathbb{Q} \\right). \\end{align} $$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cp class=\"p continuation\"\u003EAs observed in [\u003Ca class=\"xref bibr\" href=\"#r29\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"show-for-sr\"\u003EReference Petersen, Tavakol and Yin\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E29\u003C\u002Fa\u003E, Section 5.2.2], the subspace \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline389.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"15\" height=\"19\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline389.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\widetilde {\\Phi }$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E corresponds to the span of the summands where some \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline390.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"47\" height=\"18\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline390.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$i_s = 0$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. Meanwhile, modulo \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline391.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"15\" height=\"19\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline391.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\widetilde {\\Phi }$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, the subspace \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline392.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline392.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\widetilde {\\Psi }$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E corresponds to the span of summands where some \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline393.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"47\" height=\"18\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline393.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$i_s = 2$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. This follows from the formulas for the projector \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline394.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline394.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\pi _2$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E (which projects onto such summands) in [\u003Ca class=\"xref bibr\" href=\"#r29\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"show-for-sr\"\u003EReference Petersen, Tavakol and Yin\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E29\u003C\u002Fa\u003E, Section 5.1]. Quotienting by \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline395.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"52\" height=\"20\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline395.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\widetilde {\\Phi } + \\widetilde {\\Psi }$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E thus leaves the term with \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline396.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"135\" height=\"18\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline396.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$i_1 = \\ldots = i_n = 1$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. The local system \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline397.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"93\" height=\"23\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline397.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$(R^1\\pi _*\\mathbb {Q})^{\\otimes n}$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E corresponds to the \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003En\u003C\u002Fem\u003Eth tensor power of the standard representation of \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline398.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"37\" height=\"23\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline398.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\mathrm {Sp}_{2g}$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. It thus decomposes into a direct sum of irreducible local systems, as in [\u003Ca class=\"xref bibr\" href=\"#r29\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"show-for-sr\"\u003EReference Petersen, Tavakol and Yin\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E29\u003C\u002Fa\u003E, Section 3.2]. As explained there, we have a natural projection \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cdiv data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"disp-formula\" data-magellan-destination=\"eqn11\" id=\"eqn11\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"label\"\u003E(3.3)\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqn11.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqn11.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$$ \\begin{align} (R^1\\pi_*\\mathbb{Q})^{\\otimes n} \\to \\bigoplus_{|\\lambda| = n} \\mathbb{V}_{\\lambda} \\otimes V_{\\lambda^T,} \\end{align} $$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cp class=\"p continuation\"\u003Ewhose kernel is spanned by the image of the \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline399.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"20\" height=\"25\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline399.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\binom {n}{2}$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E insertion maps \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cdiv data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"disp-formula\" data-magellan-destination=\"eqnU21\" id=\"eqnU21\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqnu21.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"240\" height=\"25\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqnu21.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$$\\begin{align*}(R^1 \\pi_* \\mathbb{Q})^{\\otimes n -2} \\to (R^1 \\pi_* \\mathbb{Q})^{\\otimes n}\\end{align*}$$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cp class=\"p continuation\"\u003Egiven by inserting the class of the symplectic form. Modulo other Künneth components, the class of the diagonal \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline400.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"33\" height=\"21\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline400.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\Delta _{i,j}$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E is the class of the symplectic form in \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline401.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"246\" height=\"23\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline401.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$H^{1}(\\mathcal {C}) \\otimes H^1(\\mathcal {C}) \\subset H^2(\\mathcal {C}^{\\{i,j\\}})$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. Summarizing, we have found \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cdiv data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"disp-formula\" data-magellan-destination=\"eqnU22\" id=\"eqnU22\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqnu22.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"595\" height=\"49\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqnu22.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$$\\begin{align*}H^k(\\mathcal{C}^n)\u002F(\\widetilde{\\Phi} + \\widetilde{\\Psi}) \\cong H^{k-n}({\\mathcal{M}}_g, (R^1\\pi_*\\mathbb{Q})^{\\otimes n}) \\to \\bigoplus_{|\\lambda| =n } H^{k-n}(\\mathbb{V}_{\\lambda}) \\otimes V_{\\lambda^T}, \\end{align*}$$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cp class=\"p continuation\"\u003Eand the kernel is spanned by \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline402.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"14\" height=\"20\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline402.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\widetilde {\\Delta }$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. This establishes (\u003Ca class=\"xref disp-formula\" href=\"#eqn9\"\u003E3.1\u003C\u002Fa\u003E)\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E (b) Now assume \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline403.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"48\" height=\"16\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline403.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$n \\geq k$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. If some \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline404.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"47\" height=\"18\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline404.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$i_s = 2$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E and \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline405.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"130\" height=\"18\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline405.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$i_1 + \\cdots + i_n = k$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, we must have some other \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline406.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline406.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$i_{s'} = 0$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. It follows that \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline407.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline407.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\widetilde {\\Psi } \\subset \\widetilde {\\Phi }$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, and hence \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline408.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"105\" height=\"27\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline408.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\Psi ^k_{g,n} \\subset \\Phi ^k_{g,n}$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. Thus, it suffices to see that the right-hand side of (a) vanishes when \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline409.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"48\" height=\"16\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline409.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$n \\geq k$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E and \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline410.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline410.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$n&gt; 0$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. This is immediate when \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline411.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"47\" height=\"15\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline411.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$n&gt; k$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. Meanwhile, for the case \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline412.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"45\" height=\"15\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline412.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$n =k$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, we have \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline413.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"146\" height=\"25\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline413.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$H^0({\\mathcal {M}}_g, \\mathbb {V}_{\\lambda }) = 0$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E since \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline414.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"24\" height=\"18\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline414.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\mathbb {V}_{\\lambda }$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E is nontrivial.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E We note a neat consequence of Lemma \u003Ca class=\"xref statement\" href=\"#lemma2\"\u003E3.1\u003C\u002Fa\u003E(a) in genus \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline415.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline415.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$2$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, which was also pointed out to us by Petersen.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E \n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\"statement lemma\" data-magellan-destination=\"lemma3\" id=\"lemma3\"\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"label\"\u003ELemma 3.2.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E Suppose \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003En\u003C\u002Fem\u003E is odd. The STE generated by \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline416.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"242\" height=\"25\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline416.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$H^k({\\overline {\\mathcal {M}}}_{2,n-1}), H^{k-2}({\\overline {\\mathcal {M}}}_{2,n-1})$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E and \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline417.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"111\" height=\"25\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline417.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$H^{k-2}({\\overline {\\mathcal {M}}}_{1,m})$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E for \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline418.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline418.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$m \\leq n+2$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E contains \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline419.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"90\" height=\"25\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline419.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$H^k({\\overline {\\mathcal {M}}}_{2,n})$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"statement other\" data-magellan-destination=\"proof8\" id=\"proof8\"\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"label\"\u003EProof.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E The STE generated by \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline420.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"242\" height=\"25\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline420.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$H^k({\\overline {\\mathcal {M}}}_{2,n-1}), H^{k-2}({\\overline {\\mathcal {M}}}_{2,n-1})$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E and \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline421.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"111\" height=\"25\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline421.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$H^{k-2}({\\overline {\\mathcal {M}}}_{1,m})$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E for \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline422.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline422.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$m \\leq n+2$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E contains all classes in \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline423.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"90\" height=\"25\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline423.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$H^{k}({\\overline {\\mathcal {M}}}_{2,n})$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E that are pushed forward from the boundary, pulled back from less marked points or products of \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline424.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline424.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\psi $\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E classes with classes pulled back from less marked points. It, therefore, suffices to show that \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline425.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"276\" height=\"29\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline425.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$W_kH^k({\\mathcal {M}}_{2,n})\u002F(\\Phi ^k_{2,n} + \\Psi ^k_{2,n}) = 0$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. By Lemma \u003Ca class=\"xref statement\" href=\"#lemma2\"\u003E3.1\u003C\u002Fa\u003E(a), this quotient is a sum of the pure cohomology of local systems of weight \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003En\u003C\u002Fem\u003E. But on \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline426.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline426.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n${\\mathcal {M}}_2$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, the hyperelliptic involution acts on local systems of weight \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003En\u003C\u002Fem\u003E by \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline427.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"48\" height=\"20\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline427.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$(-1)^n$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, so local systems of odd weight have no cohomology.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E \n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\"statement other\" data-magellan-destination=\"sta1\" id=\"sta1\"\u003E\n\u003Ch2 class=\"B\"\u003EProof of Theorem \u003Ca class=\"xref statement\" href=\"#theorem2\"\u003E1.3\u003C\u002Fa\u003E.\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E Let \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline428.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline428.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$S^*$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E be the STE generated by the cohomology groups listed in the statement of the theorem. By Lemma \u003Ca class=\"xref statement\" href=\"#lemma1\"\u003E2.1\u003C\u002Fa\u003E, it suffices to check that \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline429.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"93\" height=\"26\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline429.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$S^*({\\overline {\\mathcal {M}}}_{g',n'})$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E surjects onto \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline430.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"355\" height=\"37\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline430.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$W_{k'}H^{k'}({\\mathcal {M}}_{g',n'})\u002F\\left (\\Phi ^{k'}_{g',n'} + RH^{k'}({\\mathcal {M}}_{g',n'})\\right )$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E for all \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline431.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"83\" height=\"20\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline431.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$(g', n', k')$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E with \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline432.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"87\" height=\"17\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline432.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$k' \\leq k-2$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. By Lemma \u003Ca class=\"xref statement\" href=\"#lemma2\"\u003E3.1\u003C\u002Fa\u003E(b), the target vanishes when \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline433.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"60\" height=\"16\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline433.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$n'&gt; k'$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. By the vcd of \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline434.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"56\" height=\"22\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline434.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n${\\mathcal {M}}_{g',n'}$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, it also vanishes when \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline435.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"141\" height=\"20\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline435.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$k'&gt; 4g' - 4 + n'$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. Finally, \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline436.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"104\" height=\"26\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline436.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$H^{k'}({\\mathcal {M}}_{g',n'})$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E is tautological for \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline437.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"84\" height=\"29\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline437.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$k' \\leq \\frac {2g'-2}{3}$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E [\u003Ca class=\"xref bibr\" href=\"#r35\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"show-for-sr\"\u003EReference Wahl\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E35\u003C\u002Fa\u003E].\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"statement remark\" data-magellan-destination=\"remark3\" id=\"remark3\"\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"label\"\u003ERemark 3.3.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E One can prove analogues of Theorem \u003Ca class=\"xref statement\" href=\"#theorem2\"\u003E1.3\u003C\u002Fa\u003E and Lemma \u003Ca class=\"xref statement\" href=\"#lemma1\"\u003E2.1\u003C\u002Fa\u003E for homology. In particular, for each \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003Ek\u003C\u002Fem\u003E, there is a finitely generated STE that contains \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline438.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"90\" height=\"26\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline438.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$H_k({\\overline {\\mathcal {M}}}_{g,n})$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E for all \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003Eg\u003C\u002Fem\u003E and \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003En\u003C\u002Fem\u003E, with explicit bounds on the generators.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Csection\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\"fig-ada\" data-magellan-destination=\"fig1\" id=\"fig1\"\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\"caption\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"label\"\u003EFigure 1\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003EThe argument in the proof of Theorem \u003Ca class=\"xref statement\" href=\"#theorem2\"\u003E1.3\u003C\u002Fa\u003E shows that \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline439.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"330\" height=\"27\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline439.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$W_{17}H^{17}({\\mathcal {M}}_{g,n})\u002F(\\Phi ^{17}_{g,n} + RH^{17}({\\mathcal {M}}_{g,n}))$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E vanishes for \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline440.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline440.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$(g,n)$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E outside the gray shaded region. Note that this quotient does \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003Enot\u003C\u002Fem\u003E vanish for \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline441.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"43\" height=\"20\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline441.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$(g,n)$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E equal to \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline442.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"53\" height=\"20\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline442.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$(1,17)$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E and \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline443.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"53\" height=\"20\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline443.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$(2,14)$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, which are pictured by purple dots.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"figure-thumb\"\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_fig1.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image\" width=\"908\" height=\"690\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_fig1.png\" data-zoomable=\"true\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sec\" data-magellan-destination=\"sec8\" id=\"sec8\"\u003E\n\n\u003Ch2 class=\"A\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"label\"\u003E4\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E The Chow–Künneth generation Property\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E In this section, we prove a key lemma about the cycle class map for spaces that have the following property.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\"statement definition\" data-magellan-destination=\"definition2\" id=\"definition2\"\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"label\"\u003EDefinition 4.1.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E Let \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003EX\u003C\u002Fem\u003E be a smooth algebraic stack of finite type over a field, stratified by quotient stacks. We say that \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003EX\u003C\u002Fem\u003E has the CKgP if for all algebraic stacks \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003EY\u003C\u002Fem\u003E (of finite type, stratified by quotient stacks), the exterior product \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cdiv data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"disp-formula\" data-magellan-destination=\"eqnU23\" id=\"eqnU23\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqnu23.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"251\" height=\"20\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqnu23.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$$\\begin{align*}A_*(X)\\otimes A_*(Y)\\rightarrow A_*(X\\times Y) \\end{align*}$$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cp class=\"p continuation\"\u003Eis surjective.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E For convenience, we record here several properties of the CKgP, all of which are proven in [\u003Ca class=\"xref bibr\" href=\"#r5\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"show-for-sr\"\u003EReference Canning and Larson\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E5\u003C\u002Fa\u003E, Section 3.1].\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\"statement proposition\" data-magellan-destination=\"proposition5\" id=\"proposition5\"\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"label\"\u003EProposition 4.2.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E Let \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003EX\u003C\u002Fem\u003E be a smooth algebraic stack of finite type over a field, stratified by quotient stacks. \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Col class=\"list number nomark\"\u003E\n\u003Cli class=\"list-item\"\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"label\"\u003E1.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E if \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline444.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"56\" height=\"15\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline444.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$U\\subset X$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E is open and \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003EX\u003C\u002Fem\u003E has the CKgP, then \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003EU\u003C\u002Fem\u003E has the CKgP;\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli class=\"list-item\"\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"label\"\u003E2.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E if \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline445.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline445.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$Y\\rightarrow X$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E is proper, surjective, representable by DM stacks, and \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003EY\u003C\u002Fem\u003E has the CKgP, then \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003EX\u003C\u002Fem\u003E has the CKgP;\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli class=\"list-item\"\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"label\"\u003E3.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E if \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003EX\u003C\u002Fem\u003E admits a finite stratification \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline446.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"105\" height=\"20\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline446.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$X=\\coprod _{S\\in \\mathcal {S}} S$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, such that each \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003ES\u003C\u002Fem\u003E has the CKgP, then \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003EX\u003C\u002Fem\u003E has the CKgP;\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli class=\"list-item\"\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"label\"\u003E4.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E if \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline447.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"62\" height=\"15\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline447.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$V\\rightarrow X$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E is an affine bundle, then \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003EV\u003C\u002Fem\u003E has the CKgP if and only if \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003EX\u003C\u002Fem\u003E has the CKgP;\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli class=\"list-item\"\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"label\"\u003E5.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E if \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003EX\u003C\u002Fem\u003E has the CKgP, and \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline448.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"63\" height=\"15\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline448.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$G\\rightarrow X$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E is a Grassmann bundle, then \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003EG\u003C\u002Fem\u003E has the CKgP;\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli class=\"list-item\"\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"label\"\u003E6.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E if \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline449.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"147\" height=\"18\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline449.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$X = \\operatorname {\\mathrm {BGL}}_n, \\operatorname {\\mathrm {BSL}}_n$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E or \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline450.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline450.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\operatorname {\\mathrm {BPGL}}_n$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, then \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003EX\u003C\u002Fem\u003E has the CKgP.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fol\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E If \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003EX\u003C\u002Fem\u003E is smooth and proper and has the CKgP, then the cycle class map for \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003EX\u003C\u002Fem\u003E is an isomorphism [\u003Ca class=\"xref bibr\" href=\"#r5\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"show-for-sr\"\u003EReference Canning and Larson\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E5\u003C\u002Fa\u003E, Lemma 3.11].\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E When \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003EX\u003C\u002Fem\u003E is smooth but not necessarily proper and has the CKgP, the cycle class map is not necessarily an isomorphism. Nevertheless, we have the following useful substitute (cf. [\u003Ca class=\"xref bibr\" href=\"#r20\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"show-for-sr\"\u003EReference Laterveer\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E20\u003C\u002Fa\u003E, \u003Ca class=\"xref bibr\" href=\"#r33\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"show-for-sr\"\u003EReference Totaro\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E33\u003C\u002Fa\u003E] for slightly different statements with similar proofs).\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\"statement lemma\" data-magellan-destination=\"lemma4\" id=\"lemma4\"\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"label\"\u003ELemma 4.3.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E Let \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003EX\u003C\u002Fem\u003E be an open substack of a smooth proper Deligne–Mumford stack \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline451.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"16\" height=\"19\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline451.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\overline {X}$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E over the complex numbers. If \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003EX\u003C\u002Fem\u003E has the CKgP, then the cycle class map \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cdiv data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"disp-formula\" data-magellan-destination=\"eqnU24\" id=\"eqnU24\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqnu24.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"281\" height=\"47\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqnu24.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$$\\begin{align*}\\operatorname{\\mathrm{cl}}\\colon\\bigoplus_i A_i(X)\\rightarrow \\bigoplus_k W_k H^k(X) \\end{align*}$$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cp class=\"p continuation\"\u003Eis surjective. In particular, if \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003Ek\u003C\u002Fem\u003E is odd, then \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline452.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"120\" height=\"23\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline452.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$W_kH^k(X)=0$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, and if \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003Ek\u003C\u002Fem\u003E is even, then \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline453.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"84\" height=\"23\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline453.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$W_k H^k(X)$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E is pure Hodge–Tate.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"statement other\" data-magellan-destination=\"proof9\" id=\"proof9\"\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"label\"\u003EProof.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E Set \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline454.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"92\" height=\"20\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline454.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$d:=\\dim \\overline {X}$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E and \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline455.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"96\" height=\"23\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline455.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$D:=\\overline {X}\\smallsetminus X$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. Let \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline456.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"95\" height=\"19\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline456.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\Delta \\subset \\overline {X}\\times \\overline {X}$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E denote the diagonal. Because \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003EX\u003C\u002Fem\u003E has the CKgP, the exterior product map \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cdiv data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"disp-formula\" data-magellan-destination=\"eqnU25\" id=\"eqnU25\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqnu25.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"318\" height=\"62\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqnu25.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$$\\begin{align*}\\bigoplus_{\\ell=0}^{d} A^\\ell(\\overline{X})\\otimes A^{d-\\ell}(X)\\rightarrow A^d(\\overline{X}\\times X) \\end{align*}$$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cp class=\"p continuation\"\u003Eis surjective. We have the excision exact sequence \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cdiv data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"disp-formula\" data-magellan-destination=\"eqnU26\" id=\"eqnU26\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqnu26.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"400\" height=\"25\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqnu26.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$$\\begin{align*}A^d(\\overline{X}\\times D)\\rightarrow A^d(\\overline{X}\\times \\overline{X})\\rightarrow A^d(\\overline{X}\\times X)\\rightarrow 0. \\end{align*}$$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cp class=\"p continuation\"\u003EIt follows that we can write the class of the diagonal in \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline457.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"92\" height=\"24\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline457.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$A^d(\\overline {X} \\times \\overline {X})$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E as \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cdiv data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"disp-formula\" data-magellan-destination=\"eqn12\" id=\"eqn12\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"label\"\u003E(4.1)\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqn12.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"237\" height=\"23\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqn12.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$$ \\begin{align} \\Delta = \\Gamma + \\Delta^0 + \\Delta^1 +\\cdots + \\Delta^d, \\end{align} $$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cp class=\"p continuation\"\u003Ewhere \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline458.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline458.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\Gamma $\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E is supported on \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline459.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"54\" height=\"19\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline459.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\overline {X}\\times D$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E and each \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline460.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"23\" height=\"18\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline460.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\Delta ^\\ell $\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E is a linear combination of cycles of the form \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline461.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"91\" height=\"27\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline461.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$V_i^\\ell \\times W_i^{d-\\ell }$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, where \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline462.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"22\" height=\"26\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline462.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$V_i^{\\ell }$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E and \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline463.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"46\" height=\"27\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline463.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$W_i^{d-\\ell }$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E are subvarieties of \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline464.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"17\" height=\"19\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline464.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\overline {X}$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E of codimension \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline465.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"9\" height=\"15\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline465.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\ell $\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E and \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline466.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline466.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$d-\\ell $\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, respectively.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E Let \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline467.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline467.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$p_1$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E and \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline468.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline468.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$p_2$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E be the projections of \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline469.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"54\" height=\"19\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline469.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\overline {X} \\times \\overline {X}$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E to the first and second factors, respectively. Given a class \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline470.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"133\" height=\"24\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline470.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\Psi \\in H^*(\\overline {X} \\times \\overline {X})$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, we write \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline471.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"183\" height=\"24\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline471.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\Psi _*\\colon H^*(\\overline {X}) \\to H^*(\\overline {X})$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E for the associated correspondence, defined by \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline472.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"169\" height=\"22\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline472.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\Psi _*\\alpha = p_{2*}(p_1^*\\alpha \\cdot \\Psi )$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E Let \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline473.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"119\" height=\"23\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline473.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$a\\in W_k H^k(X)$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. Let \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline474.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"12\" height=\"11\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline474.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\alpha $\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E be a lift of \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003Ea\u003C\u002Fem\u003E in \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline475.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"167\" height=\"24\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline475.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$W_k H^k(\\overline {X})=H^k(\\overline {X})$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. Then \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cdiv data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"disp-formula\" data-magellan-destination=\"eqnU27\" id=\"eqnU27\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqnu27.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"331\" height=\"25\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqnu27.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$$\\begin{align*}\\alpha = \\Delta_*\\alpha = (\\Gamma_* + \\Delta^0_* + \\Delta^1_* +\\cdots + \\Delta^d_*)\\alpha. \\end{align*}$$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cp class=\"p continuation\"\u003EFirst, we study \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline476.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"183\" height=\"25\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline476.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\Delta ^\\ell _*\\alpha = p_{2*}(p_1^*\\alpha \\cdot \\Delta ^{\\ell }).$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E Note that \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline477.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"73\" height=\"25\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline477.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$p_1^*\\alpha \\cdot \\Delta ^{\\ell }$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E vanishes for dimension reasons if \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline478.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"99\" height=\"15\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline478.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$k+2\\ell&gt;2d$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. Furthermore, since \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline479.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline479.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$p_2$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E is of relative dimension \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003Ed\u003C\u002Fem\u003E, the pushforward by \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline480.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"21\" height=\"15\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline480.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$p_2$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E of any cycle will vanish if \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline481.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"99\" height=\"15\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline481.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$k+2\\ell &lt;2d$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. Thus, the only nonzero terms occur when \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline482.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"99\" height=\"15\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline482.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$k=2d-2\\ell $\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. Moreover, \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline483.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"36\" height=\"22\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline483.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\Delta ^{\\ell }_*\\alpha $\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E is a linear combination of the form \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline484.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"82\" height=\"27\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline484.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\sum c_i W_i^{d-\\ell }$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, so it lies in the image of the cycle class map.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E Next, we study \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline485.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"32\" height=\"16\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline485.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\Gamma _*\\alpha $\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. It suffices to treat the case that \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline486.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline486.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\Gamma $\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E is the class of a subvariety of \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline487.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"55\" height=\"19\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline487.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\overline {X}\\times \\overline {X}$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E contained in \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline488.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"54\" height=\"19\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline488.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\overline {X}\\times D$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, as it is a linear combination of such subvarieties. In this case, the map \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline489.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"115\" height=\"24\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline489.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$p_2|_{\\Gamma }\\colon \\Gamma \\rightarrow \\overline {X}$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E factors through \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline490.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"66\" height=\"19\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline490.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$D\\rightarrow \\overline {X}$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. Thus, \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline491.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"32\" height=\"16\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline491.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\Gamma _*\\alpha $\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E maps to zero under the restriction to \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline492.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"84\" height=\"23\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline492.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$W_k H^k(X)$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E because the correspondence map factors through the cohomology of the boundary \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003ED\u003C\u002Fem\u003E. Thus, \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline493.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"66\" height=\"19\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline493.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\alpha |_{X}=a$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E is in the image of the cycle class map.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"statement remark\" data-magellan-destination=\"remark4\" id=\"remark4\"\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"label\"\u003ERemark 4.4.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E Essentially the same argument (only with \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline494.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"23\" height=\"18\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline494.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\mathbb {Q}_\\ell $\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E-coefficients) gives a similar statement for the cycle class map to \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline495.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"9\" height=\"15\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline495.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\ell $\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E-adic étale cohomology over an arbitrary field.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E The first two authors have previously given many examples of moduli spaces \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline496.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"49\" height=\"22\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline496.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n${\\mathcal {M}}_{g,n}$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E that have the CKgP and also satisfy \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline497.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"198\" height=\"22\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline497.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$A^*({\\mathcal {M}}_{g,n}) = R^*({\\mathcal {M}}_{g,n})$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E [\u003Ca class=\"xref bibr\" href=\"#r5\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"show-for-sr\"\u003EReference Canning and Larson\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E5\u003C\u002Fa\u003E, Theorem 1.4]. For the inductive arguments in this paper, we need more base cases in genus \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline498.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"10\" height=\"15\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline498.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$7$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. In the next section, we prove that \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline499.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"47\" height=\"21\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline499.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n${\\mathcal {M}}_{7,n}$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E has the CKgP and \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline500.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"195\" height=\"21\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline500.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$A^*({\\mathcal {M}}_{7,n}) = R^*({\\mathcal {M}}_{7,n})$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, for \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline501.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"46\" height=\"16\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline501.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$n \\leq 3$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. The table below records the previously known results from [\u003Ca class=\"xref bibr\" href=\"#r5\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"show-for-sr\"\u003EReference Canning and Larson\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E5\u003C\u002Fa\u003E, Theorem 1.4] together with Theorem \u003Ca class=\"xref statement\" href=\"#theorem7\"\u003E1.10\u003C\u002Fa\u003E.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E The following is a consequence of Lemma \u003Ca class=\"xref statement\" href=\"#lemma4\"\u003E4.3\u003C\u002Fa\u003E.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\"statement proposition\" data-magellan-destination=\"proposition6\" id=\"proposition6\"\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"label\"\u003EProposition 4.5.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E For all \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline502.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"47\" height=\"19\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline502.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$g\\leq 7$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E and \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline503.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"73\" height=\"20\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline503.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$n \\leq c(g)$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E as specified in Table \u003Ca class=\"xref table\" href=\"#tab1\"\u003E1\u003C\u002Fa\u003E, we have \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cdiv data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"disp-formula\" data-magellan-destination=\"eqnU28\" id=\"eqnU28\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqnu28.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"255\" height=\"27\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqnu28.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$$\\begin{align*}W_k H^k({\\mathcal{M}}_{g,n})=RH^k({\\mathcal{M}}_{g,n}). \\end{align*}$$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cp class=\"p continuation\"\u003EIn particular, if \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003Ek\u003C\u002Fem\u003E is odd and \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline504.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"73\" height=\"20\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline504.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$n \\leq c(g)$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, then \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cdiv data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"disp-formula\" data-magellan-destination=\"eqnU29\" id=\"eqnU29\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqnu29.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"311\" height=\"27\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqnu29.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$$\\begin{align*}W_k H^k({\\mathcal{M}}_{g,n}) = \\mathrm{gr}^W_{k} H^{k}_c({\\mathcal{M}}_{g,n})=0. \\end{align*}$$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\u003Csection\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\"table-wrap-ada\" data-magellan-destination=\"tab1\" id=\"tab1\"\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\"caption\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"label\"\u003ETable 1\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline505.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"48\" height=\"22\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline505.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n${\\mathcal {M}}_{g,n}$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E has the CKgP and \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline506.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"198\" height=\"22\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline506.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$A^*({\\mathcal {M}}_{g,n})=R^*({\\mathcal {M}}_{g,n})$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, for \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline507.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"73\" height=\"20\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline507.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$n \\leq c(g)$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, by [\u003Ca class=\"xref bibr\" href=\"#r5\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"show-for-sr\"\u003EReference Canning and Larson\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E5\u003C\u002Fa\u003E, Theorem 1.4] and Theorem \u003Ca class=\"xref statement\" href=\"#theorem7\"\u003E1.10\u003C\u002Fa\u003E.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"figure-thumb\"\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_tab1.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image\" width=\"374\" height=\"85\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_tab1.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"statement other\" data-magellan-destination=\"sta2\" id=\"sta2\"\u003E\n\u003Ch2 class=\"B\"\u003EProof of Theorem \u003Ca class=\"xref statement\" href=\"#theorem6\"\u003E1.9\u003C\u002Fa\u003E, assuming Theorem \u003Ca class=\"xref statement\" href=\"#theorem1\"\u003E1.1\u003C\u002Fa\u003E.\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E By the hard Lefschetz theorem, it suffices to prove that \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-