3E\u003Cdiv class=\"disp-formula\" data-magellan-destination=\"eqn13\" id=\"eqn13\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"label\"\u003E(5.1)\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"figure-thumb\"\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqn13.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image\" width=\"289\" height=\"99\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqn13.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cp class=\"p continuation\"\u003Ewhere \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline597.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline597.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\mathcal {C}_n$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E is the universal curve over \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline598.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"54\" height=\"22\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline598.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\mathcal {H}_{4,g,n}$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. For each \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003Ei\u003C\u002Fem\u003E, the map \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline599.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"80\" height=\"18\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline599.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$a \\circ b \\circ \\sigma _i$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E sends a pointed curve to the image of the \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003Ei\u003C\u002Fem\u003Eth marking under the Casnati–Ekedahl embedding. Taking the product of these maps for \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline600.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"95\" height=\"17\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline600.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$i = 1, \\ldots , n$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, we obtain a commutative diagram \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\"disp-formula\" data-magellan-destination=\"eqn14\" id=\"eqn14\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"label\"\u003E(5.2)\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"figure-thumb\"\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqn14.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image\" width=\"308\" height=\"112\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqn14.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"statement lemma\" data-magellan-destination=\"lemma5\" id=\"lemma5\"\u003E\n\n\u003Ch4 class=\"C\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"label\"\u003ELemma 5.1\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E (Lemma 10.5 of [\u003Ca class=\"xref bibr\" href=\"#r5\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"show-for-sr\"\u003EReference Canning and Larson\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E5\u003C\u002Fa\u003E]).\u003C\u002Fh4\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E Suppose \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline601.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"127\" height=\"30\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline601.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$x \\in A^*(\\mathcal {H}_{4,g,n}^\\Diamond )$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E lies in the image of the map \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline602.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"225\" height=\"30\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline602.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$A^*((\\mathbb {P} \\mathcal {E}^\\vee )^n) \\to A^*(\\mathcal {H}_{4,g,n}^\\Diamond )$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. Then \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline603.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"40\" height=\"21\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline603.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\beta ^{\\prime }_{n*}x$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E is tautological on \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline604.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"116\" height=\"27\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline604.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n${\\mathcal {M}}_{g,n} \\smallsetminus {\\mathcal {M}}_{g,n}^3$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E The splitting types of the Casnati–Ekedahl bundles \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003EE\u003C\u002Fem\u003E and \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003EF\u003C\u002Fem\u003E induce a stratification on \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline605.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"37\" height=\"21\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline605.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\mathcal {H}_{4,7}$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. We write \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline606.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline606.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$E = (e_1, e_2, e_3)$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E and \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline607.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"98\" height=\"20\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline607.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$F = (f_1, f_2)$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E to indicate that the bundles have splitting types \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cdiv data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"disp-formula\" data-magellan-destination=\"eqnU35\" id=\"eqnU35\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqnu35.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"527\" height=\"20\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqnu35.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$$\\begin{align*}E=\\mathcal{O}(e_1)\\oplus \\mathcal{O}(e_2)\\oplus \\mathcal{O}(e_3) \\qquad \\text{and} \\qquad F=\\mathcal{O}(f_1)\\oplus \\mathcal{O}(f_2).\\end{align*}$$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cp class=\"p continuation\"\u003EWe will consider a stratification into three pieces \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cdiv data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"disp-formula\" data-magellan-destination=\"eqnU36\" id=\"eqnU36\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqnu36.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"193\" height=\"21\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqnu36.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$$\\begin{align*}\\mathcal{H}_{4,7,n}=X_n\\sqcup Y_n \\sqcup Z_n. \\end{align*}$$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cp class=\"p continuation\"\u003EThe three strata correspond to unions of splitting types of \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003EE\u003C\u002Fem\u003E and \u003Cem class=\"italic\"\u003EF\u003C\u002Fem\u003E. The possible splitting types are recorded in [\u003Ca class=\"xref bibr\" href=\"#r6\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"show-for-sr\"\u003EReference Canning and Larson\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E6\u003C\u002Fa\u003E, Section 4.4]. The locus \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline608.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline608.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$Z_n$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E is the set of covers with maximally unbalanced splitting types, and parametrizes hyperelliptic curves [\u003Ca class=\"xref bibr\" href=\"#r6\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"show-for-sr\"\u003EReference Canning and Larson\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E6\u003C\u002Fa\u003E, Equation 4.5]. Its image in \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline609.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"47\" height=\"21\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline609.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n${\\mathcal {M}}_{7,n}$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E is contained in \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline610.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"47\" height=\"28\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline610.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n${\\mathcal {M}}_{7,n}^3$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, which has the CKgP when \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline611.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"57\" height=\"16\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline611.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$n\\leq 14$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, as noted above. We will show that \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline612.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"23\" height=\"18\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline612.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$X_n$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E and \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline613.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"19\" height=\"18\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline613.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$Y_n$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E have the CKgP and that \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline614.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"99\" height=\"21\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline614.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$A^*((\\mathbb {P} \\mathcal {E}^{\\vee })^n)$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E surjects onto the Chow ring of their union, which is \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline615.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"52\" height=\"29\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline615.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$\\mathcal {H}_{4,7,n}^\\Diamond $\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. We start with \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline616.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"23\" height=\"18\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline616.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$X_n$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E Let \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline617.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"102\" height=\"21\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline617.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$X_n\\subset \\mathcal {H}_{4,7,n}$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E denote the locus of covers with splitting types \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline618.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"101\" height=\"20\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline618.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$E = (3, 3, 4)$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E and \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline619.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"82\" height=\"20\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline619.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$F = (5,5)$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, or \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline620.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"101\" height=\"20\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline620.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$E = (3, 3, 4)$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E and \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline621.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"82\" height=\"20\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline621.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$F = (4, 6)$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\"statement lemma\" data-magellan-destination=\"lemma6\" id=\"lemma6\"\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"label\"\u003ELemma 5.2.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E If \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline622.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"46\" height=\"16\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline622.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$n \\leq 3$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E, then \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline623.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"23\" height=\"18\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline623.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$X_n$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E has the CKgP and \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline624.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"195\" height=\"21\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline624.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$A^*((\\mathbb {P} \\mathcal {E}^\\vee )^n) \\to A^*(X_n)$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E is surjective.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"statement other\" data-magellan-destination=\"proof10\" id=\"proof10\"\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"label\"\u003EProof.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E Taking \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline625.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"46\" height=\"19\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline625.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$f =4$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E in [\u003Ca class=\"xref bibr\" href=\"#r5\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"show-for-sr\"\u003EReference Canning and Larson\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E5\u003C\u002Fa\u003E, Definition 10.8], we have \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline626.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"100\" height=\"28\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline626.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$X_n = \\mathcal {H}_{4,7,n}^4$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. The result then follows from [\u003Ca class=\"xref bibr\" href=\"#r5\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"show-for-sr\"\u003EReference Canning and Larson\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E5\u003C\u002Fa\u003E, Lemmas 10.11 and 10.12] with \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline627.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"45\" height=\"19\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline627.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$g = 7$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E and \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline628.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"88\" height=\"19\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline628.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$f = f_1 = 4$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\"p\"\u003E Now let \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline629.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"98\" height=\"21\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline629.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$Y_n\\subset \\mathcal {H}_{4,7,n}$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E be the union \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cdiv data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"disp-formula\" data-magellan-destination=\"eqnU37\" id=\"eqnU37\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqnu37.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off\" width=\"143\" height=\"20\" data-original-image=\"\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_eqnu37.png\" data-zoomable=\"false\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"mathjax-tex-wrapper\" data-mathjax-type=\"texmath\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"tex-math mathjax-tex-math mathjax-on\"\u003E\n$$\\begin{align*}Y_n = \\Sigma_{2,n}\\sqcup \\Sigma_{3,n}, \\end{align*}$$\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cp class=\"p continuation\"\u003Ewhere \u003Cspan data-mathjax-status=\"texmath alt-graphic\" class=\"inline-formula\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\"alternatives\"\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\"data:image\u002Fgif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.cambridge.org\u002Fbinary\u002Fversion\u002Fid\u002Furn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20241118052945671-0407:S2050508624000246:S2050508624000246_inline630.png?pub-status=live\" class=\"aop-lazy-load-image mathjax-alternative mathjax-alt-graphic mathjax-off